    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald present 3c Avalon on Burrow Road. Picturesque 2 bed, 1 bath top (1st) floor apartment in small, low-density peaceful development set right on the beach. Presented in good condition throughout. Ideal opportunity for downsizer looking for a safe, well located and easy to maintain home as well as first time buyers and owner occupiers. Would also be an ideal investment opportunity.\n\nAccommodation briefly comprises; entrance hall with store, open plan living / diningroom to the front with balcony that has the sea view, seperate kitchen, full bathroom, 2 double bedrooms, with a second balcony off one of the bedrooms that is south facing.\n\nLocation is as close to perfect as one could get. Sitting on the exclusive Burrow Road with direct beach access unlike anywhere else in Dublin. Only a few minutes from Howth village in one direction with a host of restaurants and bars as well as scenic walks. Plus, only a few minutes from Sutton Cross in the other direction with a shopping centre. There is good public transport links with both bus and train to&from Dublin City Centre. Dublin Airport is close by too."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 1.50m x 4.75m\nIntercom, Wall Lights, Hot Press, Store.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 3.80m x 5.45m\nOpen Plan Living/Dining, Carpet, Coving, TV Point, Glass Door Out To...\n\nFront Balcony - 2.40m x 1.50m\nPrivate Balcony Overlooking Gardens, Burrow Beach And Stunning Sea View beyond with Lambay and Ireland's Eye in sight.\n\nKitchen - 2.15m x 2.55m\nFitted Shaker Style Kitchen, Oven, Hob, Extractor Fan, Plumbed For Washing Machine And Dishwasher, Tiled Splashback, Spot Lights.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.15m x 2.75m\nCarpet, Spotlights, TV Point, Glass Door To...\n\nRear Balcony - 3.30m x 1.85m\nSouth Facing, Tiled Floor, Metal Railings\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.80m x 3.75m\nFitted Wardrobe, Carpet, TV Point, Wall Light.\n\nOutside - \nSecure electronic gates from Burrow Road to residents carpark. Each apartment has a parking space. Landscaped communal gardens with lawns, flowerbeds and lighting. Direct access to Burrow Beach.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Top (First Floor)</li><li>Direct Beach Access</li><li>Sea View</li><li>Electric Heating</li><li>Double Glazed Windows</li><li>Intercom</li><li>2 X Balconies</li><li>Landscaped Gardens</li><li>Electric Gates/Resident Parking</li><li>Management Fee 1,900 p.a. approx.</ul>"
      },
